{
  "id": "basics-container-port",
  "title": "容器跑起來了，網頁卻打不開",
  "track": "basics",
  "level": 2,
  "provider": "general",
  "unitId": "containers",
  "story": "同事把網站包成容器，說「在我電腦上好好的」。你照著執行，容器明明在跑，瀏覽器打開 http://localhost:8080 卻一直連不上。看一下 Dockerfile，找出問題。",
  "objective": "建置映像檔並執行容器，讓 http://localhost:8080 能看到首頁。",
  "initialState": {
    "files": {
      "~/app/Dockerfile": "FROM nginx:alpine\nCOPY index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html\nEXPOSE 80\n",
      "~/app/index.html": "<h1>歡迎光臨雲端商店</h1>\n"
    }
  },
  "commands": [
    "cd ~/app",
    "docker build -t shop-web:1.0 .",
    "docker run -d --name shop -p 8080:{{port}} {{image}}"
  ],
  "blanks": [
    {
      "id": "port",
      "choices": [
        "80",
        "8080",
        "443"
      ],
      "answer": "80",
      "explain": "-p 主機連接埠:容器連接埠。冒號左邊是你在電腦上連的 8080，右邊要填容器裡程式真正在聽的連接埠；Dockerfile 的 EXPOSE 80 告訴你是 80。"
    },
    {
      "id": "image",
      "choices": [
        "shop-web:1.0",
        "shop-web",
        "shop-web:latest"
      ],
      "answer": "shop-web:1.0",
      "explain": "映像檔名稱包含標籤。建置時用的是 shop-web:1.0；只寫 shop-web 等於 shop-web:latest，這個標籤並不存在。"
    }
  ],
  "goals": [
    {
      "description": "http://localhost:8080 回應首頁",
      "run": "curl http://localhost:8080",
      "contains": "歡迎光臨雲端商店"
    }
  ],
  "hint": "打開 Dockerfile 看 EXPOSE 那一行；再對照 docker build -t 用的名稱和標籤。"
}
